{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隔天。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "得到万智老师的协助，我们班召开了临时班会。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为如此，现在的学园长正在为了实现明年的正式合并而奋斗……！”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3153", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理跟我与万智老师商量后，提出的议题便是……“学校合并”。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们对班上的同学说明了学园长的现状。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……对不起，本来应该要保密的。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～虽然是那样啦。”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 345, "voice": "mc0177", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是没关系，我也豁出去了。为了学生，不管开除还是减俸都没什么好怕的。”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 345, "voice": "mc0178", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“各位，到这边都了解了吗？”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 345, "voice": "mc0179", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“了、了解了……”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "ja0047", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是……”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 356, "voice": "sb0035", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，这种情况下，我们学生也帮不上什么忙……”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但还是想做点什么不是吗！”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3154", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理认真的眼神环视班上的同学。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为……希望能够正式合并嘛！”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3155", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室内静了下来。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家互相看着彼此。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……所以？”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 415, "voice": "jc0036", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，所以，我想收集大家的连署！！今天就是为了这个目的而召开临时班会。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3156", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这就是爱理跟我跟万智老师想到的，“自己可以做到的事”。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“到头来，我们学生除了把全部的事都交给学园长以外什么都做不到。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3157", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，正因为如此，我们才想要收集连署。表达有这么多学生都在期待学校合并。”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3158", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“把我们的心意传达给那个人……希望那个人能继续努力！！”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3159", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "da0031", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "结女学生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 414, "voice": "jb0024", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……？”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3160", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理的表情有点惊讶。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也不知该如何是好。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……同学们的反应，比我们预想得更冷淡。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样……什么啦？”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3161", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家不希望合并顺利吗？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3162", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……濑名同学你怎么说那种话？”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "结女学生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 414, "voice": "jb0025", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3163", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名同学不是最反对的吗……”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 415, "voice": "jc0037", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对我们来说怎么样都无所谓……但是，你的态度完全１８０度转变……”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "ja0048", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那……那是、这样没错……”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3164", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且啊，濑名同学，其实你只是不想跟瓜生分开而已吧？”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "sa0031", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什……！？”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3165", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等、等一下，为什么要提这个？”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好啦好啦男朋友跳出来说话了。”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 356, "voice": "sb0036", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“平常就是那样亲亲热热呢……因为自己很幸福，对吧？”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 415, "voice": "jc0038", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为交了男朋友，成绩一落千丈……不觉得很丢脸吗？”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "结女学生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 414, "voice": "jb0026", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那那、那是因为身体不舒服……考试结束后濑名同学不是请假了吗？老师接到电话了喔！”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 345, "voice": "mc0180", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是做了什么才感冒的？”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 415, "voice": "jc0039", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那样的人提出这种提案，只会让人觉得公私不分～”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "ja0049", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔唔……”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3166", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从前明明那么有人望的爱理──", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在在大家眼中却是这种形象。", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我说了！我只是想向学园长表达，为了正式合并希望她努力加油而已！！”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3167", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是转移话题呢。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "结女学生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 414, "voice": "jb0027", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说得真好听，一副自己最正确的样子。”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 415, "voice": "jc0040", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔～～～～”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3168", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起对议题的意见，更多的是对爱理本人的排斥──", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管说什么都没有用。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室内的气氛每一秒都在恶化。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那个，请等一下。这种时候不该针对个人攻击吧！”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不得不站出来讲话。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……结果瓜生也是那样？”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "da0032", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“合并试办开始之后，你就积极想融入这边，感觉很奇怪欸。”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "db0022", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“结果，只是想追到濑名同学而已吧？让人有这种感觉呢。”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 356, "voice": "sb0037", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "sc0029", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以啊……不赞成欸。”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "da0033", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家的排斥不只针对爱理，连我也受到攻击。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "至今为止明明很顺利的，现在却完全无法沟通。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等、等一下，总之大家先安静下来……冷静一点听他们说，好吗？好吗？”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 345, "voice": "mc0181", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3169", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理无助地看向我。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘怎么办……！？’", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘这个情况……’", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不用开口也明白。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室中充满同学们反对的视线和话语，我跟爱理几乎无法继续站在讲台上。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔──”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──好难受。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "气氛超级糟糕。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这都是……我们的错。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果是以前的我们。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我重新体认到。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为自己导致场面的气氛变糟，以前的我们大概不是忍耐就是离开……", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾……”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3170", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“──唔！”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身旁的爱理想握住我的手，她的反应让我做出了行动。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我深呼吸一口气。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;“我邂逅了！！！”", "text_idx": 6, "plain": "“我邂逅了！！！”", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室内顿时安静了下来。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学园长说过的，所谓的‘另一半’！！”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在让人不安的沉默中──我豁出去了。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为在我眼里爱理比任何人都耀眼，我被她吸引了。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、啊、欸……”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3171", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想大家都知道，爱理她比任何人都还要努力……”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在冒冷汗。身体和脑袋却发热。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我不会停下来。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为这是我真实的想法。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在我们来这里之后，大家也感觉到爱理渐渐改变了吧？”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“原本难亲近的她，现在变成大家能毫不客气地向她抱怨……”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家都知道，爱理其实是个有点傻傻的，让人无法放着不管的女孩子对吧！？”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新、新、吾。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3172", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也是个男人，遇到这样的女孩子，当然就喜欢上了！”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那个、新吾、那个、已经……”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3173", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不想要让这份心意变成一种愧疚──", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为爱理在这所结女成为了‘好女人’，所以我才喜欢上她了！！”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在讲台上、在大家面前大声地说。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……超级刺眼的放闪。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那个、我、我、啊唔……”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3174", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理满脸通红。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我大概比她更红。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉，爱理。”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“笨蛋……！”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3175", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，安静的同学们突然──", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "汎用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;“闪死了～～～～～！！”", "text_idx": 7, "plain": "“闪死了～～～～～！！”", "plain_idx": 339, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "全班同学", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": "go056", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着脸红的我们放声大笑。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、欸？”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3176", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是的～热恋中的情侣呢～！”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 415, "voice": "jc0041", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“接下来应该是濑名抱住瓜生然后接吻的剧情吧～”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "sa0033", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸欸欸欸欸！？”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3177", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“她说‘笨蛋’耶！唔唔～好想被人这样骂喔～～！！”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "da0035", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，但是该说的不是那句吧？是‘我也喜欢你瓜生！’才对呀～！”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "ja0050", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生，你太逊了！唔哈哈哈，快点下台啦！”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "db0024", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“快啊快啊濑名同学，接吻、接吻、接吻！”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 415, "voice": "jc0042", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那……那种事……怎么可能在大家面前做嘛！”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3178", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“慌张了慌张了，啊哈哈、啊哈哈哈，真的是闪死了～～！”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 356, "voice": "sb0039", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃、呃那个……”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔～～～～”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3179", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怎么回事──", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家笑着起哄、挖苦我们，我们已经慌到手足无措了。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“结……结果是怎么样啦大家！！希望合并还是不希望啊……！？”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3180", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理几乎是哀号地大喊。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“赞成～我也想要这样的邂逅啊！”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ht0251", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊赞成赞成，安洁也是！”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": "ag0592", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太和安洁举起了手。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然我有美羽学姐了无所谓……不过对你们来说是生死危机啊～”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 412, "voice": "sn0205", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学的一句话似乎说出了大家的心声──", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "sa0034", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我……我也是！我也想要邂逅！”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 415, "voice": "jc0043", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也是我也是！只有瓜生遇到好事真的不能忍～！难得的和结女学生一起生活的机会，千万不要结束啊！”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "da0036", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也是、我也是……同学们纷纷表态。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也有想像濑名同学一样找到另一半、只有女生的学校没办法这样……之类的意见。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那个，所以，那么……？”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3181", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也就是说……”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "结女学生们", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "go057", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“女子学校太无趣了！”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "结女学生们", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "go058", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "ar3182", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……哈哈……！”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──原来是这样。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着率先成为情侣关系的我和爱理，大家只是稍微有点忌妒而已……的样子。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟爱理互看了一眼。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你……！”“谢谢你……！”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理／新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar3183", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们同时道谢，结果又被大家糗了一番。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
